0..78 Comment "//! An arm that hands its recursive call to another definition, unfolded at an"
79..155 Comment "//! open argument: the call is stuck at the argument\'s variable, and the arm"
156..230 Comment "//! goes on into the other definition\'s call over it. Each step states one"
231..308 Comment "//! unfolding of the recursion as a path, as an arm that returns constructors"
309..385 Comment "//! over its call converts (`nested-call-sugar.gandr`). Structural recursion"
386..464 Comment "//! unfolds only at a constructor [Abel-2004-termination_checking_with_types]."
465..468 Comment "//!"
469..501 Comment "//! - see: #761 — `doubleStep`"
502..558 Comment "//! - cites: [Abel-2004-termination_checking_with_types]"
559..562 Comment "//!"
563..687 Comment "//! [Abel-2004-termination_checking_with_types]: https://doi.org/10.1051/ita:2004015 \"Abel, Termination checking with types\""
